sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant TargetTable
    participant SourceTable

    Client->>PostgreSQL: Executes MERGE command
    PostgreSQL->>SourceTable: Reads source rows
    PostgreSQL->>TargetTable: Reads target rows

    alt MATCHED (Source row matches Target row)
        PostgreSQL->>TargetTable: Executes UPDATE (if specified)
        PostgreSQL->>TargetTable: Executes DELETE (if specified)
    else NOT MATCHED BY TARGET (Source row does not match Target row)
        PostgreSQL->>TargetTable: Executes INSERT (if specified)
        alt INSERT ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE
            PostgreSQL->>TargetTable: If conflict, executes UPDATE
        else INSERT ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
            PostgreSQL->>TargetTable: If conflict, skips insert
        end
    end

    alt NOT MATCHED BY SOURCE (Target row does not match Source row)
        PostgreSQL->>TargetTable: Executes DELETE (if specified)
        PostgreSQL->>TargetTable: Executes UPDATE (if specified)
    end

    Client->>PostgreSQL: Receives result (affected rows)
